2013 Sep 12: NSMAXG replaces NSMAX
2013 Sep 12: added models for H at B12=0.01,0.04,0.07,0.1 (g14=2.4); models are fully ionized, while partially ionized models will replace these when available.
2015 Nov 24: partially ionized models for H at B12=0.04,0.07,0.1 (g14=0.4-25) available on request; will upload to Xspec in future.
